WEBVTT

00:00:00.582 --> 00:00:07.505
Good afternoon Cathy. This is day two of the
CIDESCO World Congress 2026 and

00:00:07.505 --> 00:00:12.763
we're here with Cathy and Cathy's
just taken the 90-second

00:00:12.762 --> 00:00:14.866
Digital Wellness Reset experience.

00:00:14.866 --> 00:00:20.002
Cathy, how do you feel after taking this
experience, the 90-second experience, and

00:00:20.002 --> 00:00:24.828
what kind of cybersecurity message do you feel
that you could take away today?

00:00:25.254 --> 00:00:27.818
Well I have to say I had to do it twice

00:00:27.942 --> 00:00:32.585
just because the first experience was so
wonderful I had to get another repeat of

00:00:32.585 --> 00:00:37.227
it. And it's really just nice to step away from
feeling the dependency on my poor

00:00:37.227 --> 00:00:42.042
watch that is constantly beeping me and my phone
that's telling me what I need to do

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:42.730
or be or do,

00:00:42.982 --> 00:00:45.811
so it was nice to sort of do
a reset on that.

00:00:45.811 --> 00:00:48.074
And it's a good reminder too that

00:00:48.806 --> 00:00:53.226
when we read our emails and check everything
else around that we should just

00:00:53.862 --> 00:00:58.520
step back. We do have 90 seconds to step back
and we should take advantage of it.

00:00:58.520 --> 00:01:00.992
So thank you. Thank you for
the experience.
